    "title": "Pitkin County official accepts Winter Park town manager position - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Jon Peacock has been selected to serve as town manager of Winter Park, starting Jan 12, according to a press release from the town. Before accepting the position, he was employed as the county manager in Pitkin County, Colo. He has worked in local government for over 25 years, including three years as assistant county administrator and five years as county administrator in Mesa County. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
